  "title": "Tom Szaller&#39;s Great Pan or Bird Stuffing",
  "description": "This great sausage and bacon stuffing contains so many ingredients, some say it could be a meal in itself. Bake it as a side dish, or use it to stuff the bird.",
  "authors": [
    "Allrecipes Member"
  ],
  "date_published": "2008-06-30T19:10:59-04:00",
